#: slug-sync.php:1679
msgid "Changes matching slugs in batches and records reports for downloads and undo. Use this after reviewing a preview."
msgstr ""

#: slug-sync.php:1684
msgid "Apply will change live URLs."
msgstr ""

#: slug-sync.php:1685
msgid "Take a database backup first. Existing indexed URLs are recorded for redirection, and a redirect CSV is created as a second layer."
